      propertyPath: noteText
      value: 'Maintenance Log:


        The pressure system keeps rerouting itself
        whenever the valves are adjusted. From what I can tell, several of the pipes
        share the same lines.


        Changing one route may shut down another
        somewhere else in the facility.'
