    - target: {fileID: 8788657266811987503, guid: 10048d6369a0bcc49a8cbb8b16b2ba9d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: noteText
      value: 'We''ve had so many power failures that the company started stockpiling
        replacement fuses all over the facility.


        I saw one of the test
        subjects carrying one earlier, but when I cornered him he didn''t have it
        anymore. If I had to guess, he probably hid it somewhere in his room before
        he turned.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
