    - target: {fileID: 8788657266811987503, guid: 10048d6369a0bcc49a8cbb8b16b2ba9d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: noteText
      value: 'Those monsters react to noise. Even small sounds seem to draw them
        in.


        Rocks, radios, broken equipment... you can use them to distract
        the creatures and slip past unnoticed. Just be careful not to trap yourself
        while doing it.


        Press Q to throw a pebble.

        Use the scroll
        wheel to cycle through your inventory.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
