    - target: {fileID: 8788657266811987503, guid: 10048d6369a0bcc49a8cbb8b16b2ba9d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: noteText
      value: 'I don''t know when you''ll read this, but you were too heavy to carry
        out. Those things are everywhere now... attacking anyone they find.


        Most
        of the doors run off emergency power, but the system keeps failing. You''ll
        need to find replacement fuses and restore power through the fuse boxes if
        you want to get anywhere.


        Good luck. You''re going to need it.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
