    - target: {fileID: 8788657266811987503, guid: 10048d6369a0bcc49a8cbb8b16b2ba9d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: noteText
      value: 'After all the testing, we''ve been exposed to some kind of biochemical
        contamination. I don''t know exactly what it is, but it''s getting worse.


